# Mocks go in your .http files, next to the requests that call them.
# The first poll gets 503 pending. Every poll after that gets 200 completed.

### Poll payment
# @mock method=GET path=/payments/{id} sequence=polling
HTTP/1.1 503 Service Unavailable
Retry-After: 1

{"status": "pending"}
---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK

{"status": "completed"}
